Here's the problem file for preparing sandwich components:

```pddl
(define (problem prepare_sandwich_problem)
  (:domain robot1)
  (:objects
    robot1 - robot
    bread - object
    lettuce - object
    tomato - object
    knife - object
    cuttingBoard - object
    counterTop - object
  )
  (:init
    (not (inaction robot1))
    (at robot1 counterTop)
    (at-location bread counterTop)
    (at-location lettuce counterTop)
    (at-location tomato counterTop)
    (at-location knife counterTop)
    (at-location cuttingBoard counterTop)
  )
  (:goal
    (and
      (at-location bread cuttingBoard)
      (at-location lettuce cuttingBoard)
      (at-location tomato cuttingBoard)
    )
  )
)
```

Problem file generation is done.